<title>NETHERLANDS: Getronics sees continuing growth.</title>
<headline>Getronics sees continuing growth.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics firm Getronics NV said on Friday it expected continuing growth in net sales and earnings.</p>
<p>&quot;Within the relevant market segments for the Group, a market growth is expected for 1997 which at least equals the growth seen in 1996.... Apart from unforeseen developments, a continuing growth in net sales and earnings is expected,&quot; Getronics said in a statement.  </p>
<p>It said it would concentrate on internal growth, but planned to make purchases.</p>
<p>&quot;The Getronics strategy remains focused on internal growth in order to take advantage of favourable market conditions. Furthermore, an active acquisition policy will be pursued,&quot; Getronics said.</p>
<p>Earlier, the firm reported a 1996 net profit of 131.6 million guilders.</p>
